# Claude Code project skills: local guidance for driving implementation sessions, not a
# project artifact collaborators need from git.
.claude/

# Jac build/runtime artifacts (cache, venv, persisted graph data) for the root jac-studio project.
.jac/

# Tracker site build output (tracking/site's build script writes here regardless of which
# branch is checked out; the site is deployed via GitHub Actions, never committed).
dist/

# Client (web-app) build tooling.
node_modules/

# Local fixture workspace for manually/programmatically verifying jac-studio's own features
# (Explorer, search, SCM, task runner, native LSP client, ...) end to end -- a testing aid, not a
# product artifact, and never committed. See jac-studio-implementation's "Keeping testing-workspace
# current" section for what it covers and when to update it. It's a real, separate git repo of its
# own (nested inside this one on purpose, so SCM features have something real to point at) -- do
# not run destructive git commands here without first `cd`-ing in and confirming you're inside it.
testing-workspace/
